# A crooked on a real SoMa ledge (the south rear runway's, soma-5050-ledge's approach): I + up + toward
# (backside: the ledge on the left, so left) as it locks on: BS Crooked Grind. The contact test seats it
# with the view's own probe of the park (tests/trickcontact.test.ts).
park soma
spawn south_rear_runway_to_hellride
cmd 0 speed 4.5
hold ollie 4..14
hold up 36..60
hold left 36..60
tap grind 40
bot balance
run 360
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Crooked Grind,slide=false} within 20..80
expect no event bail
